      "writtenOn": "2025-01-07T05:20:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why is that? is there no risk of concurrent access? i don\u0027t see any docs on the type that make that clear. if the `MiscDevice::mmap` caller is making this gaurentee, could it pass a `\u0026mut VmAreaNew` instead?\n\nsame for the other unsafe `VmAreaNew` blocks below",
