      "writtenOn": "2025-01-07T12:34:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `VmAreaNew` type is not `Sync` and must only be created during initial vma setup before the vma is shared with the rest of the kernel, so concurrent access is not a risk.\n\nUsing `\u0026mut VmAreaNew` would not work because using `std::mem::swap` on it would cause mayhem.\n\nI updated the safety comment, ptal.",
      "parentUuid": "2cc3de9e_9d805133",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "e5e83daa6c13121dc05d65a953b946e759d2b4d2",
