        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T00:13:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks!\n\nIs there more I can read about the `std::mem::swap` concern somewhere? I guess the issue is that `VmAreaNew` is backed by an actual `vm_area_struct`, not a pointer to it, so you can\u0027t force a reference holder to only mutate through the rust API?",
      "parentUuid": "9a2b6768_1fff05b2",
      "range": {
