        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T00:13:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, you\u0027d need to use `Box::as_ptr` to hold onto it outside the lock. It doesn\u0027t elimate the unsafe, I just thought it would look cleaner and the memory ordering of the static w.r.t. the mutex would be clearer\n\nMarking as resolved since it is just an idea",
      "parentUuid": "ac746469_e8daba48",
      "revId": "e5e83daa6c13121dc05d65a953b946e759d2b4d2",
